00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:18,000
Terrifier 2 is a horror, thriller film directed by Damien Leone.

3
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:54,000
A year after the Miles County massacre, Art the Clown
is resurrected by a sinister entity.

4
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:30,000
